    "text": "Reports to the Chairman of the Board of Ajuba International, Inc."
  },
  {
    "id": "c085",
    "name": "Schedule 2.1 Board Meetings",
    "text": "Attend Board Meeting every quarter to present activities for previous quarter and plans for next quarter."
  },
  {
    "id": "c086",
    "name": "Schedule I Closure of Ajuba’s UK Office",
    "text": "SCHEDULE I Closure of Ajuba’s UK Office Employee shall oversee closing down the Ajuba UK operations, which includes transitioning out of the office and out of the Company’s employment relationships with the UK based employees."
  },
  {
    "id": "c087",
    "name": "Schedule I UK Office Cost Estimate",
    "text": "Employee estimates that the annual costs associated with operating Ajuba’s UK office is approximately: Salary/Bonus for Shakti Singh $325,000 _ Salary/Bonus for Nazima Ballum $125,000 Retainer for Rajan Bhabra $ 60,000 Employee Benefits Expenses $ 24,000 Associated Travel & Marketing Expenses $ 36,000 Office Lease Payments $ 15,000 Other Miscellaneous Expenses $_ 15,000 $600,000"
