    "name": "Schedule I Novi Office Cost Estimate",
    "text": "Employee estimates that the costs associated with operating Ajuba’s Novi, MI office is approximately: Office Lease Payments and Related $65,000 Expenses (¢.g., utilities, janitors, telecom, etc.)"
