    "name": "Schedule I Estimates and No Warranty",
    "text": "The estimated cost savings and risk assessments described herein are based on Employee’ s good faith estimates. Employee makes no representation or warranty regarding actual cost savings or 19 ~-2:11-cv-12936- MOB- ‘LIM Doc # 11-3° Filed 10/47/11 Pg 22 of 22 ~Pg ID 189 © client reaction to the Contemplated Transactions (as defined in the Stock Purchase Agreement dated June __, 2005, by and among Employee, MiraMed and the other parties thereto)."
